<title>USA: General Instrument CommScope unit buys plant.</title>
<headline>General Instrument CommScope unit buys plant.</headline>
<dateline>HICKORY, N.C. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Instrument Corp's unit CommScope Inc said on Thursday it purchased the former Rubbermaid Health Care Products plant in Statesville, North Carolina.</p>
<p>The 310,00 square foot plant in Statesville will join CommScope's other North Carolina sites in Claremont, Catawba and Elm City.</p>
<p>CommScope Inc manufactures coaxial cable and supplies high-performance electronic cables.</p>
